{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：18:00 2026-10-12 HKT</p>\n\n<p>陳欣健大女陳易遙（前名陳早茵）在演藝界與名流圈交遊廣闊，近日獲李嘉欣與其夫許晉亨熱情邀約共進晚餐。合照中可見李嘉欣甜蜜依偎在老公許晉亨身旁，兩人笑容燦爛，而陳易遙則手持名貴酒樽，可見私交甚篤。陳易遙在IG限時動態中幽默寫道：「I've been called upon by 食神夫婦 again！Always spoiling me with the best food and booze！I think last night was the first time I could 行到直線返屋企。感恩」，可見眾人聚會相當盡興。</p>\n<h2>陳易遙與李嘉欣同月同日生結緣</h2>\n<p>有指陳易遙與李嘉欣因同月同日生日而結下緣分，二人私底下經常相聚慶祝。兩年前陳易遙慶祝50歲生日時，曾大搞主題派對，現場星光熠熠堪比大型頒獎禮，當時李嘉欣與許晉亨也有到賀。</p>\n<p>作風低調、打扮中性的陳易遙背景相當顯赫，其父是前警司兼電影人陳欣健，母親為前邵氏女星「尤情」張蓉蓉，叔父為資深演員陳國新，是不折不扣的演藝世家。憑藉父母在圈內的人脈，她與何超瓊、劉嘉玲及英皇娛樂藝人皆是好友。</p>\n<p>相關閲讀：群星為猛人慶生！佘詩曼關之琳同場鬥靚 鍾鎮濤開騷連跌兩次後現身狀態曝光</p>\n<img alt=\"陳欣健（後排右）在70年代已經加入影壇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/20569d37b043df694329b5af21783a72/2024-01/enp20p22270208.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳欣健的太太是60年代邵氏女星張蓉蓉（尤情）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4bc6083e42f186ba120a03112495e581/2024-05/22_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張蓉蓉在1973年與陳欣健結婚後淡出娛樂圈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a5abcfe70ec7dd2404b66ea11851358b/2024-05/25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳欣健和女兒出席活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b5008be187067515e1a8d0bb99405011/2024-05/EC10L09.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙是陳欣健長女，前名陳早茵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cf6f11df41743c098fb67dd7a011ea0/2024-01/Snapinsta_app_19227759_1287083424738747_6123378686868586496_n_1080.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳欣健父女關係要好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/da52c823760a1af81bf0c6e9acd9b0f2/2024-01/aj9f4984.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙為媽媽慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/922316e99a4d335332f94c5af68675f6/2024-05/the_joanne_chan_1508172513_1626991426381215714_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣與老公許晉亨近日邀陳欣健大女陳易遙食飯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3df659fb2b616ee3fd00d9d1b93ae20e/2026-10/CHAN_1__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙（左）與李嘉欣好老友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c9e63c889a5fa04b4e16503e322ce1c/2026-10/CHAN_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙生日與家人一同慶祝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c24e434e1cadfc15a0ee9c11bbfaa60b/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1625192808_2608628806110223006_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳欣健大女陳易瑤近年成為佘詩曼經理人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6811fefb1b65d7353aee9fe373d204a1/2024-01/charmaine_sheh_1705373359_3281232016376299459_1819466566.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"佘詩曼紅足多年，陳易遙陪出陪入曝光率亦隨之大增。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a5d419f6df2523f8e046d03e017050ac/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1592927899_2337971132127108745_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有指佘詩曼當年離巢TVB後，在陳易遙建議下開設工作室。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bff6a6d4fbebdd44ad35f2adc9e81ca7/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1518273122_1711721471238056466_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙不時跟佘詩曼飛來飛去。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38509238099db55781f570f2451a3c68/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1675931829_3034258561463851451_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有指當時佘詩曼一度想推《延禧攻略》，最終在陳易遙則游說下接拍，最後成功令佘詩曼在內地爆紅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f9b06a065a2ce089b34a233b5f422a9/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1533728974_1841374561179086610_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙是陳欣健長女，前名陳早茵。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3cb7a0f5432db29069b1e04e0702766/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1579948443_2229091563446093665_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙曾從事金融業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c2cc6f74b829ff808f8ab3b84362a35/2024-06/A_1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙50歲生日時曾辦派對，名媛邱李茂琪與老公邱子傑到賀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5de7eaae054d81e8d092795e73f88876/2024-06/B_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙與譚詠麟合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fdcdc775da7ae863801b6d0271a5e9f7/2024-06/_2_____1_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙（左五）與阿Sa是多年好友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da43d8377bd56d835309c4e902284386/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1625192808_2608628806093482869_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙與容祖兒相熟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6c9cca3c5cb219f9c055ca4c73b93e8/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1491673455_1488587298169458286_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳欣建與楊受成的好交情亦延續下至一代，陳易遙與楊受成楊黛思亦是好閨密。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/963fe24a351ff5b93d09a4ab9c035c10/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1579948661_2229093390996528336_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙的IG上經常見到與楊黛思合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce58ea0a295a1312d06a412e430b86ea/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1453051920_1164606372878540370_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙曾與楊黛思一同到劉嘉玲府上作客。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a9c25823901fa4062fcfa04aad9c2d9/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1578571825_2217543657019311599_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙與何超瓊是好友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f587a25746c5f86b73f9c9b36f72d563/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1472062126_1324075542811315750_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳易遙在圈中人緣甚廣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/633e75fd63175418cb6310aa2a19a00a/2024-01/the_joanne_chan_1687241885_3129134191774499548_1386334.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳易遙推佘詩曼登事業高峰</h2>\n<p>同時，陳易遙亦是佘詩曼（阿佘）的經理人。早在阿佘10年前約滿離巢TVB時，已有指在陳易遙的建議下，她開設了個人工作室，並由陳易遙出任經理人，全權打點海內外事務。當年內地宮廷巨製《延禧攻略》曾力邀阿佘飾演「嫻妃」，當時她因顧慮戲路重複而有意推辭，全賴陳易遙獨具慧眼，極力遊說她接拍，最終成功將阿佘的事業推上第二高峰。</p>\n<p>相關閲讀：79歲殿堂級電影人大女好受歡迎！跟前TVB花旦開工變集郵目標 母為前邵氏女星</p>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣與老公許晉亨早前出席吳婉芳二仔的婚宴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/86a7918437d1971bf0682a6e8932684e/2026-05/12_30.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣與許晉亨近年經常放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3145f06a2c6a64e674506f054d477223/2023-09/michele_monique_reis_177067200_1418708805147621_3954973550256506110_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣的性感晚裝，側身時陷走光邊緣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/193365d1076eda8e6a03ebf72e2ba209/2026-05/cap1_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣有最美港姐之稱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e10e8107d949674a3e894265af4223a0/2024-07/369036345_278138971593319_7440325603299597911_n_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣與許晉亨在端午節分享的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/515ab57360fd10a9130cd7a6b74e8318/2026-06/001SQPdYgy1iealixgu8mj60xc18gwmj02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"56歲的李嘉欣，歲月完全沒有在她身上留下痕跡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94c67a8056463df50e16259ef9da2f6d/2026-06/001SQPdYgy1iealixtn3uj616o1kwdpl02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣與老公許晉亨及兒子Jayden，一家三口幸福美滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b00b6d34e8b5596d642c53f152bd0c99/2026-05/03_michele.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣年過半百，但keep得好fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ce532ded7c0c74bf1b47a7c1ca889c2/2022-10/290341873_3240494012855988_6648678564968854934_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣早前與友人一起預祝母親節，網民大讚李嘉欣肌膚緊緻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4eb2a10cd277215ac522308cbcd29cd2/2026-05/3888639787519669427_204867510.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣的囝囝不在身邊，改為攬實友人女兒，母愛滿瀉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49075796ff1db4745ade4b8008af0d9f/2026-05/3888639788652134676_204867510.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣2008年11月嫁富商許晉亨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8231e77445e0525766f7137278f633b7/2023-10/LEEKAYAN_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣與許晉亨已婚多年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ac4d5a5b74b87468792d6dd31551f449/2022-11/unknown_259816088_452993103183451_4043812426770037452_n_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2008年李嘉欣與許晉亨舉行「世紀婚禮」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1712e712691b82949c63c568b834c329/2022-11/shot02_0033.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣早前更新IG曝光最新狀態，一頭金髮讓人眼前一亮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/035a7c429bff4f4f004d94978741cf9f/2026-04/1_4_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣早前到日本賞櫻，身心也保持著最佳狀態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb17ae010d98d47e70f83c0a36fc0a33/2026-04/2_3_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣過養尊處優的生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6abe267c56a5af2d7fe43cfa485807e/2023-06/2022_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李嘉欣同許晉亨穿情侶裝恩愛同粉絲拜年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eda6dcb4fe9814b51bce396430c456e0/2026-02/1_33.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=